.env
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Everything this example reads is fetched and everything it writes is output.
#
# data/          the recorded run, downloaded by `python3 fetch.py` from the
#                pinned revision of superlinked/sie-task-evidence
# pdfs/          the source PDFs, downloaded by `uv run fetch-documents`. Two
#                are investor documents whose rights notes say not to
#                redistribute the complete PDF, and the Docling paper is left
#                fetch-only in deference to the same note even though it is
#                CC BY 4.0. data/inputs/sources.json pins every URL, digest and
#                byte length, which is what a reader needs to confirm they
#                fetched the same bytes.
# runs/          new run bundles written by `uv run convert-documents`
# run-output/    evaluations written by `uv run eval-documents`
#
# This example used to commit data/ and runs/, because it had been built to
# commit nothing at all and its published result -- "all 25 checks passed" --
# then had no record behind it that anyone could check. The evidence is still
# there to be checked; it now lives on Hugging Face rather than in this
# repository, pinned by revision and by digest.
data/
pdfs/
runs/
run-output/
